The problem requires calculating the technical and citation proportions for given paragraphs and their citation focus texts. The proportion is defined as the ratio of the length of the citation focus text to the length of the entire paragraph text. The technical proportion is then \(1 - \text{citation proportion}\).

For the provided example paragraph:
