- Citation focus text: "The results are also available in the technical report [1]."

The length of the paragraph text is 88 characters, and the length of the citation focus text is 48 characters. The citation proportion is \(48 / 88 = 0.545454...\), which rounds to 0.55 (to two decimal places). The technical proportion is \(1 - 0.55 = 0.45\).

Thus, for paragraph 1, the technical proportion is 0.45 and the citation proportion is 0.55.

